From 7b1789f7548e9d9b2ba481186a3d5c6256ac0047 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keweiya <58689883+keweiya@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:11:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix(module): declare static scope so LSPosed loads into
 the HyperOS launcher

The launcher is spawned by hyos_spawner, and LSPosed only injects modules that
declare staticScope=true there (com.miui.home.tweaks, the only module visible in
that process, declares minApiVersion=102 + staticScope=true). Without this the
home hooks - including the folder auto-close patch - never load.
---
 .../libhook/src/main/resources/META-INF/xposed/module.prop   | 5 ++---
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/library/libhook/src/main/resources/META-INF/xposed/module.prop b/library/libhook/src/main/resources/META-INF/xposed/module.prop
index f893fca33..3bccadae1 100644
--- a/library/libhook/src/main/resources/META-INF/xposed/module.prop
+++ b/library/libhook/src/main/resources/META-INF/xposed/module.prop
@@ -1,4 +1,3 @@
-minApiVersion=101
+minApiVersion=102
 targetApiVersion=102
-autoHotReload=true
-staticScope=false
+staticScope=true
